{
  "id": "b2-e20-becoming-independent",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Becoming independent",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you live with your family or on your own?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, at what age do you think people should live on their own?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you find most difficult about being independent?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how much do you depend on your family for advice?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e20-a1",
            "b2-e20-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show young people at home. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations is more like yours? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e20-b1",
            "b2-e20-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show young people starting to live on their own. Compare the photographs, and say what difficulties the people might have.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you like to live on your own? Why or why not?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that help young people become independent, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e20-becoming-independent",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help young people become independent?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e20-becoming-independent",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most important for a young person?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about young people and independence.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that young people nowadays leave home too late. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think it is the parents' responsibility to teach independence?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, what skills should schools teach to help young people live on their own?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it easier or harder to be independent than it was for your parents' generation?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can young people manage their money better?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e20-becoming-independent/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
